exact width occupation support unresolved.","boundary_rule":"Attributed author approximate width; no numerical threshold or paired edge coordinates extracted.","source_url":"https://eprints.utas.edu.au/13585/7/2000_Cresswell_Currents_rst.pdf","source_citation":"Cresswell, G. (2000), Currents of the continental shelf and upper slope of Tasmania, Papers and Proceedings of the Royal Society of Tasmania 133(3):21–30, doi:10.26749/rstpp.133.3.21.","source_locator":"Introduction, printed p21 / PDF page 1, paragraph on Baines et al. (1983). Separate Strahan sections: pp24–25 and Figure 5C p28 / PDF page 8.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-08","source_evidence_kind":"published_original_attributed_historical_regional_summary","extraction_method":"Approximate width from visually reviewed original paragraph; qualitative section comparison transcribed separately, no velocity-contour digitization.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"Attributed historical Bass Strait slope width","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"source_quality_note":"The 40 km summary is attributed to Baines et al. (1983); March/December 1997 Strahan widths remain numerically unknown. Neither the survey depth nor later seasonal calendar supplies this width support.","remaining_gates":["Resolve original width boundary operator, layer and occupation support.","Extract compatible dated paired boundaries before numerical seasonal ranges.","Independent scientific admission."],"original_regional_context":{"width_passage_visually_inspected":true,"underlying_width_source":"Baines, Edwards & Fandry (1983), doi:10.1071/MF9830155, as attributed in Cresswell Introduction.","underlying_width_methods_reviewed":false,"historical_width_is_1997_section_widt