rom tidal-model predictions. Deployment spans October 2002-October 2004 with site-specific gaps; identical averaging times and weights unresolved. Effective depth, grid spacing and velocity confidence are not a width slab or width error. Seasonal velocity changes do not supply seasonal widths.","display_aria_label":"Pesaro: 50 km reported width of a mean surface-flow profile. Southern section BB-prime. Two locations do not establish a 40-50 km seasonal range. No mapped width edges.","audit_file":"research/western-adriatic-chavanne-2007-mean-width-scope-audit.json","audit_sha256":"61d4d2dfdccb2c51c70d0487ab393a7359bb5b75b8ac5d0d89e7c8adf12ee9fa","audit_pointer":"/measurements/1"}},{"id":"jutland-skov-2019-coastal-water-mass-breadth","current_id":"jutland","name":"Jutland Current","status":"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical","measurement_type":"published_regional_summary","width_metric":"author_reported_current_width","approximate_width_km":null,"width_range_km":[10,20],"range_kind":"reported_typical_regional_width_span","range_interpretation":"Report describes a 10-20 km surface-water-mass breadth in a regional geographic synthesis. Not paired velocity boundaries, a confidence interval, annual extrema or a whole-current width.","geographic_scope":"Surface water mass along the west Jutland coast from Henne Strand north of Horns Rev to Skagen; Wadden Sea offshore traceability and habitat zones have separate support.","section_geometry":null,"section_orientation":"Reported coastal water-mass breadth; no transverse velocity section or paired geographic edges extracted.","layer":"Surface water mass; fixed numerical depth bounds not supplied for this breadth.","time_convention":"Undated regional synthesis in a report approved September 2019. December 2018 modeled maps and seasonal seabird distributions do not date the width statement.","boundary_rule":"Report-provided water-mass breadth citing Nielsen (1999); salinity threshold, paired edges and underlying width method remain unresolved.","source_url":"https://ens.dk/media/5628/download/","source_citation":"Skov, Mortensen and Tuhuteru (2019), Site selection for offshore wind farms in Danish waters: Investigations of bird distribution and abundance, DHI for Energistyrelsen / Danish Energy Agency, project 11823165, final approved 18 September 2019.","source_locator":"Section 2.3, printed p15 / PDF p27 (10-20 km); PDF p26 preceding oceanographic context; Figure 6 PDF p28; section 3.1.1.1 printed pp23-24 / PDF pp35-36 distinguishes habitat and alternate reach; title/credits PDF pp1,3.","source_retrieved_date":"2026-10-09","source_evidence_kind":"government_water_mass_geographic_synthesis_citing_prior_source","extraction_method":"Reported breadth span transcribed from visually inspected original prose. No map digitization, salinity contour diagnosis or velocity-core inference.","whole_current_representative":false,"width_rank_eligible":false,"full_width_inference_eligible":false,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"seasonal_playback_eligible":false,"is_confidence_interval":false,"phase_label":"Coastal surface-water-mass breadth","phase_kind":"regional_summary","observed_period":null,"calendar_months":null,"fixed_layer_bounds_m":null,"uncertainty_km":null,"source_quality_note":"Agency-hosted DHI geographic water-mass synthesis. Nielsen thesis reprint now inspected at selected pages: separate 40, 25 and 20-25 km satellite-image estimates cite Aarup (1994a). Exact DHI 10-20 km phrase not confirmed in the reviewed Nielsen width passage. Original imagery methods and North/South label relations remain unresolved.","remaining_gates":["Recover Nielsen (1999) and the underlying water-mass boundary definition.","Resolve North/South Jutland label relations independently of this regional breadth.","Recover compatible repeated sections, dates, depth and geographic edges before seasonal widths or mapped bands.","Independent scientific and canonical admission."],"original_regional_context":{"source_access":"unchanged_agency_pdf_selected_pages_reviewed","description_kind":"water-mass-breadth","source_class":"agency_hosted_environmental_synthesis","quantity_scope":"surface_water_mass_breadth_not_velocity_core_width","source_current_label":"Jutland Current / Continental Coastal Water","underlying_source_citation":"Nielsen, Mads Hvid (2000), Dynamisk beskrivelse og hydrografisk klassifikation af Den Jyske Kyststrom, DMI Scientific Report 00-15, ISBN 87-7478-425-0. Reprint of April 1999 University of Copenhagen master thesis; reprint preface October 2000.; satellite-image width passage in section 2.4 cites Aarup (1994a), whose original remains unreviewed.","underlying_width_methods_reviewed":false,"salinity_threshold_extracted":false,"paired_width_boundaries_extracted":false,"surface_label_is_fixed_depth_layer":false,"width_occupation_dates_resolved":false,"publication_year_is_width_occupation":false,"modeled_map_month":"2018-12","modeled_map_date_is_width_occupation":false,"model_map_is_width_measurement":false,"offshore_context":{"location":"Wadden Sea","traceability_almost_km":100,"core_typically_within_km":40,"are_paired_width_edges":false,"are_range_endpoints":false},"habitat_context":{"location":"just north of Horns Rev","zone_around_km":40,"depth_zone_m":[15,30],"higher_density_cutoff_birds_km2":0.75,"is_current_width":false,"bathymetry_is_width_layer":false,"bird_seasonality_is_width_series":false},"alternate_geographic_context":{"source_locator":"printed p23 / PDF p35","reported_breadth_km":20,"reach":"Ringkobing Fjord to Skagen","is_preferred_width":false,"is_dated_width_sample":false,"is_independent_measurement":false},"naming_context":{"naming_audit_file":"research/jutland-current-naming-scope-audit.json","naming_audit_sha256":"4520258deb2ac71bae2269b2c4cf78bf6c47d4c7c20057d68aa08acb89c6d350","north_south_aliases_resolved":false,"canonical_alias_admitted":false,"norwegian_coastal_width_inheritance_eligible":false},"span_is_annual_range":false,"full_report_reviewed":false,"protocol_file":"plans/jutland-water-mass-breadth-protocol-v1.md","protocol_sha256":"e687f7c05ab6febeea1d8e6180a24bca4a34c09b7d72a37612628eb95d65a4d1","display_caption":"Jutland: reported 10-20 km coastal surface-water-mass breadth from Henne Strand to Skagen. Not a velocity-core width, confidence interval or seasonal range. No mapped width edges.","display_method_note":"Surface-water-mass synthesis. The inspected Nielsen thesis gives separate site-specific satellite estimates citing unreviewed Aarup (1994a); this review does not corroborate the exact 10-20 km phrase. Offshore traceability, core confinement, bird habitat and December 2018 model maps remain separate support. No pooled seasonal range or resolved North/South aliases.","display_aria_label":"Jutland: reported 10-20 km coastal surface-water-mass breadth from Henne Strand to Skagen. Not a velocity-core width, confidence interval or seasonal range. No mapped width edges.","supporting_original_review":{"source_document_file":"research/source-data/nielsen-jutland-2000/journal-article.pdf","source_document_sha256":"29e027afd56877b6acec02382a8a6a2e5b2ecce24572171c2e15c1f1ae071525","source_document_bytes":4292648,"acquisition_file":"research/source-data/nielsen-jutland-2000/acquisition.json","acquisition_sha256":"ee96523fe882310b4bc2a72c14b04df6d1985c977739551b0b4779bbda8e28da","source_citation":"Nielsen, Mads Hvid (2000), Dynamisk beskrivelse og hydrografisk klassifikation af Den Jyske Kyststrom, DMI Scientific Report 00-15, ISBN 87-7478-425-0. Reprint of April 1999 University of Copenhagen master thesis; reprint preface October 2000.","selected_pages_reviewed":[1,3,7,22,23,71,140],"reprint_link_established":true,"exact_10_20_phrase_confirmed_in_reviewed_width_passage":false,"primary_satellite_methods_reviewed":false,"is_independent_corroborating_measurement":false},"audit_file":"research/jutland-skov-2019-water-mass-breadth-scope-audit.json","audit_sha256":"c3fdcff1113465b8a14a0cc78bcee043b