he-tasman-front/","locator":"Author institutional abstract, retrieved 2026-10-13","access":"Abstract read; full 2019 article not acquired. Original temperature-data reinterpretation, reanalysis and drifters suggest discontinuous streams/eddy field; continuous zonal flow less common than conceptual models imply."}],"candidate_file":"research/tasman-historical-connection-reach-reference-path-candidate.json","candidate_sha256":"f6f60ba8fee67cf1f8163b6f616f664c674e2a7977d36c0d420c0e9c8407a80d","generator_sha256":"1362693ec7075e014d065691923248db455a5c3cd78c9a94880b3b472594d240","figure":"figures/tasman-historical-connection-reach-reference-path-candidate.svg","nominal_atlas_state_crossings":["NEWZ","TASM"],"recommended_nasa_tile_id":"level2_G_5","remaining_gates":["Independently review identity, layer, selected gates and fine coastline/bathymetry before physical admission.","Acquire dated velocity or suitable physical geometry before measuring a current axis or meander length.","Whole-current length, physical width and annual ranges remain unresolved.","No seasonal playback, occupied polygon, physical state containment or NASA current identity inferred."],"parent_current_id":null,"parent_scope_note":null,"ordering_sensitivity":null},{"id":"somali-winter-reference-path-candidate","current_id":"somali","name":"Somali Current","status":"editorial_reference_path_candidate_not_scientifically_reviewed","comparison_group":"osw_approximate_reference_routes","scope":"Northeast-monsoon southward Somali coastal branch from an OSW northern gate at 7 N to an OSW confluence gate at 3 S. Source latitude ranges are 6-8 N for divergence and 2-4 S for confluence with East African Coast Current. Excludes the northward flow north of the divergence, offshore feeder, eastward continuation, undercurrents and gyre circuits. No year-round whole-current extent asserted.","route_extent_kind":"winter southward coastal branch","approximate_reference_path_km":1500,"scenario_range_km":[1100,1800],"sc