 northern latitudes fail complete monthly support. Missing observations are not land or zero flow; the northern pattern peaks at the retained data edge.","Latitude bands are paper classification context, not current boundaries. Principal-component coefficients are not local current speeds.","Three latitude windows and both native columns remain separate. Similarity within one product is not independent validation or a confidence interval.","Exact author domain/weighting/code were unavailable; this experiment is not an exact reproduction."],"next_evidence":"Independent flow association and comparable transverse velocity sections before physical-width admission.","figure_file":"figures/indian-secc-eof-feasibility.svg","figure_alt":"Three statistical loading patterns and monthly coefficients at two native longitudes. Northern support is incomplete; no current width is admitted.","source_file":"research/indian-secc-eof-classification-feasibility.json","source_pointer":"","source_links":[{"label":"Inspect all fits and comparisons","document":"research/indian-secc-eof-classification-feasibility.json","pointer":""},{"label":"Inspect acquisition receipt","document":"research/source-data/oscar-indian-eof-1995-2016/acquisition.json","pointer":""},{"label":"Inspect declared calculation","document":"research/source-data/oscar-indian-eof-1995-2016/preflight.json","pointer":""}],"original_url":"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2022JC019147","table":{"caption":"Primary-window variance by native column; statistical patterns, not named-current widths.","headers":["Native longitude","Mode 1","Mode 2","Mode 3"],"rows":[["80.333°E","51.3%","19.0%","14.0%"],["80.667°E","51.0%","18.5%","14.6%"]]},"kind":"current_research_evidence","rank_eligible":false,"new_width_record_admitted":false,"whole_current_width_km":null,"annual_width_range_km":null,"geometry_role":"research_evidence_no_current_axis_or_physical_width_geometry","figure_sha256":"65cb81417d19c9b4ebb1f6cbd1