t-ingoy-months-2024/originals-pilot-2023-12.zip":"333643bf51e7d28b20abb8803f1cf712d2771ad6d6ae0ad2c1da07b88ee38fcf","research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/originals-pilot-2024-01.zip":"cba843500a7262ccf5be2044858cf3b7bbc07fe91ac208ced641a167320ae3d7","research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/originals-pilot-2024-02.zip":"dc095b8308e0a3e0a935bc3ad053560eb08c1eb9e320731d770a6726fab1b3cf","research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/originals-pilot-2024-06.zip":"256ab09ddf50330b6cfefbbd9ec70fed1020b1870771fd91f1f7f6f00606527b","research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/originals-pilot-2024-07.zip":"9be8b2d1650d867e6c2bfe5f27dc0958a5989892bc4ae26538f1973f2c14500e","research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/originals-pilot-2024-08.zip":"3e10069f4ec449fe814ead7ac8a310f6dd7d875e694cf7bc795a13d35622d6d6","plans/scientific-calculation-readback-protocol-v1.md":"be6497b880a634084c7244150b3c517aa1dc776c29a340043dabf0daa2a16192","analysis/scientific_readback.py":"291392b7fcedcace9e8115819871b3f3de9cbf325d52c4db4c8680b30af634ac","analysis/build_norkyst_continuous_sections.py":"5fa0e64de88bf65d32003d708cd069f44071f4fb1d485bf826a94e7023a0fdc1","analysis/norkyst_continuous_source.py":"bd5aa0e7693030af275b7ecdf55875bd016a97d89f00a0d0cb23559646fecae5","plans/norkyst-ingoy-within-month-support-2026-10-17.md":"aac3cd4bc388e2c56b772e3d1878af75b8c60bd3d2504990b7d9104a7d94ef6f","plans/norkyst-ingoy-monthly-regional-map-rules-2026-10-17.md":"e08c49970f9382a45c0c6baf5ad2efdd61426aec1ee2db21d0a2b2ce78442394"},"generator_sha256":"0dd4f87859f508f36d2ed26debd2b3b0c151d82704a1e945345c039e2cea4193","regional_maps":{"file":"research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/regional-monthly-means-year.json","sha256":"c3cbba3c7568e45f0bc52255050b2e421b834d4d4dd55166041a66b4b8dbaf6b"},"interpretation":"Complete calendar sampling of model fields at one offshore fixed section and10m layer. Low-pass filtering attenuates tides and other high-frequency variation, not a complete harmonic tidal solution. The section does not establish coastal coverage, physical current identity or boundaries. Monthly distributions are not confidence intervals or annual physical width extrema.","new_width_record_admitted":false,"whole_current_width_km":null,"annual_width_range_km":null,"annual_extrema_eligible":false,"rank_eligible":false,"physical_geometry_admitted":false},"research_evidence":{"current_id":"norwegian-coastal","label":"Norwegian Coastal Current","diagnostic_id":"diagnostic:current-research:norwegian-coastal","title":"Complete 2024 model year: monthly maps and sections","finding":"All twelve months retain 8,784 hourly model fields at 10 m, with complete support at the 191 fixed section positions. This improves seasonal sampling in the offshore Ingoy region; the section is not a verified current axis or a current-width measurement.","facts":[{"label":"Calendar coverage","value":"12 months · 8,784 hours"},{"label":"Model layer","value":"10 m · 2024"},{"label":"Current width","value":"Unknown"},{"label":"Annual width range","value":"Unknown"}],"notes":["Monthly means use all calendar hours, including leap day. Source spacing is 800 m; retained spacing is 3.2 km. Interpolated section positions add no native resolution.","The 24/24/25-hour low-pass convolution attenuates tides and other high-frequency variability. It is not a harmonic tidal solution.","Temporal standard deviations and sample quantiles describe model variability, not confidence intervals or current-width uncertainty. Serial dependence remains.","This is a single model year at one layer, not observations, a climatology or a depth average. The offshore region does not establish coastal extent or physical current edges.","The declaration records prior exposure to twelve isolated snapshots; no fully blinded preregistration is claimed. Modified Norkyst data: MET Norway / Institute of Marine Research, CC BY 4.0.","Calculated readbacks use a declared precision for reproducibility. That precision is not observational uncertainty or an annual range. Original source values, masks and quality flags remain unchanged; the exact record pins the calculation rules."],"next_evidence":"Establish flow association and comparable paired physical boundaries before admitting a current width or annual width range.","figure_file":"figures/norkyst-ingoy-complete-year-maps.svg","figure_alt":"Twelve monthly low-pass model salinity maps at 10 m with mean velocity arrows and the fixed 24 degrees east section. These are regional model fields, not current boundaries.","additional_figures":[{"file":"figures/norkyst-ingoy-complete-year-sections.svg","alt":"Monthly raw and low-pass mean salinity and velocity sections for all twelve months."},{"file":"figures/norkyst-ingoy-complete-year-variability.svg","alt":"Monthly temporal model standard deviations, raw and low-pass. These are not uncertainty intervals."}],"source_file":"research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/section-diagnostic-year.json","source_pointer":"","source_links":[{"label":"Inspect monthly means, quantiles and support","document":"research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/section-diagnostic-year.json","pointer":"/months"},{"label":"Inspect complete-year acquisition","document":"research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/acquisition-year.json","pointer":""},{"label":"Inspect figure provenance","document":"research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/figure-year.json","pointer":""},{"label":"Inspect declared source and filtering rules","document":"research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/preflight.json","pointer":""},{"label":"Inspect monthly regional means","document":"research/source-data/norkyst-ingoy-months-2024/regional-monthly-means-year.json","pointer":"/months"}],"original_url":"https://thredds.met.no/thredds/catalog/romshindcast/norkyst_v3/zdepth/catalog.html","table":{"caption":"Complete hourly section support in each calendar month of 2024; current width remains unknown.","headers":["